  "goodToKnow": "Der Schreiber is someone who writes: der Schreiber dieses Briefes. Historically, it was a scribe or clerk. For literary authors, German uses der Schriftsteller or der Autor. Colloquially, especially in southern Germany and Austria, ein Schreiber is also a pen. Der Kugelschreiber (Kuli) is a ballpoint pen, and der Schreiberling is a hack writer. Schreiber is also a common German surname."
